WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 18

01:27.800 --> 01:30.180
(Zhu Mansion)

01:30.200 --> 01:32.470
(Opera)
Phoenix Hairpin?

01:32.490 --> 01:33.670
Tonight's first opera

01:33.690 --> 01:35.550
is Phoenix Hairpin.

01:35.570 --> 01:36.750
Do you mean to

01:36.770 --> 01:38.880
show everyone in Lingshui

01:38.900 --> 01:40.510
that I'm as evil as Mrs. Lu in it,

01:40.530 --> 01:42.360
breaking up you and my son?

01:42.380 --> 01:43.720
I wouldn't dare.

01:43.740 --> 01:45.050
I had left for charity when operas

01:45.050 --> 01:46.280
needed to be chosen.

01:46.300 --> 01:47.220
When I returned,

01:47.220 --> 01:48.690
I heard you had decided on them.

01:48.690 --> 01:50.220
Stop lying!

01:50.530 --> 01:51.750
Are you saying

01:51.770 --> 01:53.130
I chose that one in particular

01:53.150 --> 01:54.730
to insult myself?

01:54.820 --> 01:56.240
You're disrespectful to me.

01:56.260 --> 01:58.280
I can have my son divorce you.

01:58.300 --> 02:00.650
Mother, it really wasn't me.

02:03.810 --> 02:06.120
Mother, I'm not Lu Wuguan.

02:06.140 --> 02:07.930
I won't listen to you to divorce Yi.

02:07.930 --> 02:09.780
It'll never happen, Mother.

02:10.050 --> 02:12.090
Get up, Yi.

02:18.330 --> 02:19.880
I ordered that opera,

02:19.900 --> 02:20.980
not Yi.

02:20.980 --> 02:22.340
You...

02:22.860 --> 02:24.600
You're still covering for her?

02:24.620 --> 02:25.460
If you were

02:25.460 --> 02:26.720
a kind mother-in-law,

02:26.740 --> 02:28.310
you wouldn't fear rumors.

02:28.330 --> 02:29.470
In the last few days,

02:29.490 --> 02:30.650
Yi went here and there

02:30.650 --> 02:32.310
for the Water Festival.

02:32.330 --> 02:34.070
Not only did you not help her,

02:34.090 --> 02:35.840
but you also kept picking on her.

02:35.860 --> 02:36.930
How unfilial!

02:36.930 --> 02:38.000
That's enough.

02:38.020 --> 02:39.740
Don't be mad, Mother.

02:39.740 --> 02:40.900
It's all my fault.

02:40.900 --> 02:41.910
Mrs. Ziyu!

02:41.930 --> 02:43.290
Mrs. Ziyu!

02:44.180 --> 02:45.020
Mrs. Ziyu,

02:45.020 --> 02:46.330
the Caiyun Troupe is a mess.

02:46.330 --> 02:48.400
- You kicked me!
- Stop, you two!

02:48.420 --> 02:49.780
You vamp!

02:51.050 --> 02:52.250
Stop, ladies!

02:52.250 --> 02:53.250
That's enough!

02:53.270 --> 02:54.660
- I'm begging you!
- I'll kill you!

02:54.660 --> 02:55.980
- How dare you!
- It's my fault!

02:55.980 --> 02:57.210
It's my bad, alright?

02:57.210 --> 02:58.800
I shouldn't have given you that lip balm.

02:58.800 --> 02:59.620
- I'm sorry!
- Stop.

02:59.620 --> 03:00.980
It's your fault!

03:06.420 --> 03:08.160
It's a big day today.

03:08.180 --> 03:10.440
You two are the stars of the Caiyun Troupe.

03:10.460 --> 03:12.250
Why are you fighting?

03:12.490 --> 03:13.720
What's going on?

03:13.740 --> 03:15.200
Sorry for the trifle.

03:16.330 --> 03:17.630
Trifle?

03:17.650 --> 03:19.220
Look at my face!

03:20.980 --> 03:22.530
She caused it!

03:22.720 --> 03:25.640
(Yanniang, Caiyun Troupe)

03:27.810 --> 03:29.740
It's an allergy caused by yams.

03:30.620 --> 03:31.750
She's taken the medicine,

03:31.770 --> 03:33.070
but it'll take six hours

03:33.090 --> 03:34.850
at least to reduce the swelling.

03:35.090 --> 03:36.160
That's too long.

03:36.180 --> 03:37.180
I have to go on stage

03:37.180 --> 03:38.540
in less than two.

03:38.740 --> 03:41.060
Are there other ways, Physician?

03:41.090 --> 03:42.750
There's nothing else I can do.

03:42.770 --> 03:44.130
Good day.

03:45.900 --> 03:47.300
Where was yam

03:47.300 --> 03:48.700
added to the lip balm?

03:48.700 --> 03:49.820
Ask her!

03:49.840 --> 03:50.860
I've said a million times

03:50.860 --> 03:52.250
I didn't do it.

03:52.290 --> 03:53.510
Ms. Fei,

03:53.530 --> 03:55.180
I bought a new lip balm, Half Cherry,

03:55.180 --> 03:56.540
for you.

03:56.580 --> 03:58.750
Wear that to go on stage tonight

03:58.770 --> 04:00.300
and you'll outshine everyone.

04:00.300 --> 04:02.630
I outshine others for my performance,

04:02.650 --> 04:03.880
not for my looks.

04:03.900 --> 04:05.550
Is that so?

04:05.570 --> 04:06.600
In that case,

04:06.620 --> 04:08.030
don't put on any makeup.

04:08.050 --> 04:10.020
Perform onstage without it.

04:11.180 --> 04:14.260
Meng, I'll take it if she won't.

04:14.380 --> 04:15.220
I picked up

04:15.220 --> 04:16.990
this lip balm for her.

04:17.010 --> 04:18.030
If you also want it,

04:18.050 --> 04:19.640
I'll get you one next time.

04:21.490 --> 04:23.030
You grab everything that's mine.

04:23.050 --> 04:25.050
Take it if you like it.

04:26.980 --> 04:29.010
No wonder you gave it away to me.

04:29.010 --> 04:30.100
Turns out, the lip balm

04:30.100 --> 04:31.050
had been tampered with.

04:31.050 --> 04:33.030
I didn't even open the box.

04:33.050 --> 04:33.930
How could I do that

04:33.930 --> 04:34.910
without touching it?

04:34.930 --> 04:37.050
We all know you're a mutt from Nanwu.

04:37.180 --> 04:38.420
You're full of tricks.

04:38.420 --> 04:39.340
Who's a mutt?

04:39.340 --> 04:40.180
You!

04:40.180 --> 04:41.430
You're a mutt!

04:41.450 --> 04:42.810
Stop arguing.

04:43.740 --> 04:45.670
The box doesn't seem to have a hidden switch.

04:45.690 --> 04:46.720
Mr. Meng,

04:46.740 --> 04:48.850
where did you buy the lip balm?

04:49.660 --> 04:51.620
From the rouge shop

04:51.620 --> 04:53.280
on the west side of the city.

04:53.540 --> 04:54.640
After you bought it,

04:54.660 --> 04:55.440
did you bring it

04:55.440 --> 04:56.900
with you the whole time?

04:58.690 --> 05:00.320
Just now, before I performed,

05:00.340 --> 05:02.340
I put the box on the table over there.

05:03.300 --> 05:04.550
That vamp did it.

05:04.570 --> 05:05.570
She didn't want me

05:05.570 --> 05:06.990
to perform Phoenix Hairpin

05:07.010 --> 05:08.460
to outshine her.

05:10.010 --> 05:12.970
Phoenix Hairpin? Did Mother...?

05:15.130 --> 05:16.600
Set the lip balm aside for now.

05:16.620 --> 05:18.110
It's almost showtime.

05:18.130 --> 05:19.400
Given Yanniang's condition,

05:19.420 --> 05:20.760
she can't sing.

05:20.780 --> 05:21.760
Mrs. Ziyu, we sing

05:21.780 --> 05:23.860
with the throat, nose, and stomach,
not the mouth.

05:23.860 --> 05:24.720
I can do it.

05:24.740 --> 05:26.030
But you can't go up there

05:26.050 --> 05:27.410
looking like this.

05:30.930 --> 05:33.380
I have an idea, Yi.

05:45.450 --> 05:50.140
Yes! Good! Great!

05:56.930 --> 05:58.300
The Zhu Mansion

05:58.320 --> 05:59.780
celebrates this year's Water Festival

05:59.780 --> 06:01.220
with style and grace.

06:01.490 --> 06:02.910
Zhu's celebration

06:02.930 --> 06:04.700
has always been the best.

06:05.620 --> 06:06.870
Of course.

06:06.890 --> 06:07.860
To prepare for it,

06:07.860 --> 06:10.290
I didn't get a good night's sleep.

06:10.540 --> 06:11.620
Didn't Mrs. Ziyu

06:11.620 --> 06:12.980
do all the work?

06:13.010 --> 06:15.670
Had Mrs. Lu had such a great daughter-in-law,

06:15.690 --> 06:17.370
Phoenix Hairpin wouldn't have been written.

06:17.370 --> 06:18.840
That's too kind of you.

06:18.860 --> 06:19.910
I'm young and ignorant.

06:19.930 --> 06:21.540
Mother planned out everything.

06:21.540 --> 06:23.460
I simply ran errands for her.

06:24.690 --> 06:25.660
Enjoy the show.

06:25.660 --> 06:27.290
It's about to begin.

06:27.340 --> 06:30.700
- Great!
- Wonderful!

06:30.780 --> 06:34.730
- Beautiful!
- Excellent!

06:35.980 --> 06:37.340
Good!

06:51.370 --> 06:54.340
How nice!

06:56.250 --> 06:59.800
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

06:59.820 --> 07:03.200
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

07:03.470 --> 07:09.440
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

07:10.600 --> 07:14.230
♪ East wind unfair ♪

07:14.250 --> 07:17.760
♪ Happy times rare ♪

07:17.780 --> 07:21.270
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

07:21.290 --> 07:24.800
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

07:24.820 --> 07:30.880
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

07:57.060 --> 08:00.790
♪ Spring is as green ♪

08:00.810 --> 08:04.100
♪ In vain she's lean ♪

08:04.220 --> 08:11.320
♪ Her kerchief soaked with tears,
red with stains unclean ♪

08:11.520 --> 08:15.060
♪ Peach blossoms fall ♪

08:15.080 --> 08:18.570
♪ Near deserted hall ♪

08:18.590 --> 08:24.930
♪ Our oath is still there, lo ♪

08:24.950 --> 08:32.420
♪ No words to her can go ♪

08:33.080 --> 08:40.190
♪ No, no, no ♪

08:41.010 --> 08:42.630
- Nice!
- Great!

08:42.650 --> 08:44.580
- Good!
- Beautiful!

08:44.650 --> 08:45.490
How divine!

08:45.490 --> 08:46.770
The Caiyun Troupe

08:46.770 --> 08:48.040
deserves its name.

08:48.060 --> 08:49.770
Mrs. Ziyu, Yan went missing.

08:49.770 --> 08:51.850
- Nice.
- It's really good.

08:54.770 --> 08:56.150
What happened?

08:56.170 --> 08:57.580
Wasn't she with you the whole time?

08:57.580 --> 08:58.980
I was buying osmanthus cakes.

08:58.980 --> 09:00.870
When I turned around, she was gone.

09:00.890 --> 09:02.100
The streets are packed tonight.

09:02.100 --> 09:04.060
I can't lose her.

09:04.100 --> 09:06.080
- Mrs. Ziyu.
- Captain Xie.

09:06.100 --> 09:07.410
What's the emergency?

09:07.410 --> 09:08.560
Yan went missing.

09:08.580 --> 09:09.940
Could you help me look for her?

09:09.940 --> 09:10.800
Don't panic.

09:10.820 --> 09:12.840
Let's split up and search.

09:12.860 --> 09:14.350
Sure. Thanks.

09:14.370 --> 09:15.700
Azhu, you go that way.

09:15.700 --> 09:17.260
- I'll go this way.
- Yes.

09:45.820 --> 09:47.220
Mr. Yu,

09:48.170 --> 09:50.180
why are you watching it from here?

09:51.010 --> 09:53.220
It's got a great view.

09:54.580 --> 09:57.220
The groom on the boat just now

09:57.740 --> 09:59.580
looked somewhat like you.

10:02.250 --> 10:03.610
Really?

10:06.530 --> 10:08.060
Everyone has two eyes and a nose.

10:08.060 --> 10:09.700
Plus, he wore a mask.

10:10.170 --> 10:11.530
We could be similar.

10:17.740 --> 10:19.100
What's that?

10:26.530 --> 10:27.530
When I came back earlier,

10:27.530 --> 10:29.220
Mr. Meng didn't feel well.

10:29.220 --> 10:31.170
He asked me

10:31.170 --> 10:33.150
to do that show for him.

10:33.170 --> 10:35.940
You had to point out it wasn't him.

10:37.980 --> 10:39.420
Is that so?

10:46.130 --> 10:48.300
Fine, I insisted on doing it.

10:50.220 --> 10:51.720
But why?

10:51.740 --> 10:53.820
I couldn't see you marry another man.

10:54.650 --> 10:56.820
Pardon? I didn't get it.

11:01.890 --> 11:02.860
I couldn't see you

11:02.860 --> 11:03.980
marry another man

11:04.000 --> 11:05.490
even in a show!

11:25.230 --> 11:27.510
Great!

11:31.410 --> 11:33.040
Bad news, ma'am.

11:33.060 --> 11:34.650
Ms. Fei sprained her ankle.

11:35.060 --> 11:36.080
What?

11:36.100 --> 11:37.600
Are you alright, Ms. Fei?

11:37.620 --> 11:38.740
What to do?

11:38.740 --> 11:40.420
My performance is next.

11:40.490 --> 11:41.560
Have a seat.

11:41.580 --> 11:43.250
Tonight's top priority is

11:43.250 --> 11:44.440
the Water Festival.

11:44.460 --> 11:45.980
The ritual dance is most important,

11:45.980 --> 11:47.150
but now, it can't be done.

11:47.170 --> 11:48.560
That'll bring shame

11:48.580 --> 11:50.300
on our whole clan!

11:50.940 --> 11:53.100
You... It's your fault.

11:53.100 --> 11:54.290
You knew you had to dance

11:54.290 --> 11:55.920
but acted so carelessly.

11:55.940 --> 11:57.300
Where's Yi?

11:57.370 --> 11:58.890
Where did she go?

11:58.980 --> 12:00.040
My Lady,

12:00.060 --> 12:02.340
we looked all over the Yunshui Tower

12:02.340 --> 12:04.350
but found no sign of her.

12:04.370 --> 12:06.230
She must be avoiding me

12:06.250 --> 12:07.630
to make me

12:07.650 --> 12:09.150
clean up the mess.

12:09.170 --> 12:10.800
(Where did Yi go?)

12:10.820 --> 12:12.360
(She cares about the Festival the most.)

12:12.360 --> 12:14.200
(She'd never leave without reason.)

12:14.220 --> 12:15.600
(What exactly happened?)

12:15.620 --> 12:17.730
Yan! Yan!

12:17.940 --> 12:19.580
- Ma'am.
- Did you see a little girl?

12:19.580 --> 12:20.870
Did you see her?

12:20.890 --> 12:21.990
No, sorry.

12:22.010 --> 12:23.150
Yan!

12:23.170 --> 12:24.770
Did you see a little girl?

12:24.770 --> 12:26.600
- I didn't.
- Ms. Fei,

12:26.620 --> 12:28.110
do you have

12:28.130 --> 12:29.750
a replacement in your troupe?

12:29.770 --> 12:31.470
The ritual dance is the hardest.

12:31.490 --> 12:33.700
No one else can do it.

12:35.650 --> 12:37.340
I happened to learn to dance

12:37.340 --> 12:38.630
in my childhood.

12:38.650 --> 12:39.580
When I served

12:39.580 --> 12:41.130
in the Yunshui Tower these days,

12:41.130 --> 12:42.370
I saw Ms. Fei dancing.

12:42.370 --> 12:43.770
I can give it a try.

12:52.010 --> 12:53.250
Beautiful!

12:53.250 --> 12:54.700
It's good, isn't it?

12:54.700 --> 12:55.650
Great!

12:55.650 --> 12:57.010
It's nice.

13:02.460 --> 13:04.130
First, Yanniang had an allergy.

13:04.130 --> 13:05.820
Then Ms. Fei sprained her ankle.

13:05.820 --> 13:08.090
Yet she happened to learn that dance.

13:08.220 --> 13:10.470
All that couldn't be a coincidence.

13:10.490 --> 13:12.090
Just now, Ms. Fei said

13:12.290 --> 13:14.800
yam could trigger her asthma,

13:14.820 --> 13:17.540
making her too weak to dance.

13:17.820 --> 13:18.860
Qing'er's target

13:18.860 --> 13:19.700
was Ms. Fei

13:19.710 --> 13:20.920
from the very beginning.

13:20.940 --> 13:23.040
Yanniang used that lip balm

13:23.060 --> 13:24.650
with yam by accident.

13:24.670 --> 13:26.230
Who knows

13:26.250 --> 13:28.540
her scheme actually worked?

13:28.580 --> 13:30.270
She set your sister up

13:30.270 --> 13:32.330
and then stepped forward to save the day

13:32.530 --> 13:35.090
to impress the Zhu Clan.

13:35.820 --> 13:38.800
- She's more than she lets on.
- Good!

13:38.820 --> 13:40.280
There's no time to lose.

13:40.740 --> 13:41.960
I'll go find my sister.

13:41.980 --> 13:43.220
Watch Qing'er closely.

13:43.220 --> 13:44.600
We'll split up.

13:44.620 --> 13:45.980
Be careful.

13:49.170 --> 13:50.530
Yan!

13:50.580 --> 13:51.920
Yinlou!

13:51.940 --> 13:53.110
Miss Si.

13:53.130 --> 13:54.820
Did you see Yi?

13:55.530 --> 13:56.860
She thought Yan had gone missing.

13:56.860 --> 13:58.690
She must still be looking for her.

13:58.820 --> 14:00.940
Yan, who was there with you?

14:00.940 --> 14:02.390
How did you get lost?

14:02.410 --> 14:03.340
I didn't.

14:03.340 --> 14:05.350
(Yan, Jiang Yi's Daughter)
I fell asleep.

14:05.370 --> 14:08.420
Then I saw Mr. Xie after waking up.

14:08.890 --> 14:10.470
She didn't wander away herself.

14:10.490 --> 14:12.460
Someone must've taken her away.

14:12.620 --> 14:14.060
But why?

14:17.100 --> 14:18.460
I get it.

14:18.650 --> 14:20.700
That was to drive Yi away.

14:21.220 --> 14:22.370
Let's split up

14:22.370 --> 14:23.290
and find her.

14:23.290 --> 14:24.130
Sure.

14:24.140 --> 14:25.130
Take Yan with you.

14:25.130 --> 14:26.200
- Sure.
- Alright.

14:26.220 --> 14:27.820
Be good, Yan.

14:29.740 --> 14:31.100
Let's go.

14:43.620 --> 14:44.980
Yi!

14:45.130 --> 14:46.490
Yi!

14:47.700 --> 14:49.040
(Ms. Fei couldn't perform.)

14:49.060 --> 14:50.510
(Qing'er's plan worked.)

14:50.530 --> 14:51.840
(Why bother to)

14:51.860 --> 14:53.540
(drive Yi away?)

14:55.650 --> 15:00.460
- Great!
- Wonderful!

15:06.620 --> 15:07.980
How clumsy!

15:09.980 --> 15:11.610
You were so careless.

15:12.740 --> 15:13.960
Let's go, Mother.

15:13.980 --> 15:15.440
You need to get changed.

15:17.860 --> 15:19.220
Yan!

15:28.340 --> 15:29.730
Yan...

15:37.820 --> 15:39.180
Yi!

16:17.460 --> 16:19.770
Yi! Yi!

16:20.010 --> 16:21.370
Wake up!

16:22.700 --> 16:23.940
Where's Yan?

16:23.960 --> 16:24.820
Where's my daughter?

16:24.820 --> 16:25.960
She's fine.

16:25.980 --> 16:27.340
Don't worry.

16:34.820 --> 16:36.870
Yi! What's wrong?

16:36.890 --> 16:38.170
She's having an asthma attack.

16:38.170 --> 16:39.960
I brought her here to rest.

16:39.980 --> 16:41.230
An asthma attack?

16:41.250 --> 16:42.560
How useless!

16:42.580 --> 16:43.980
She's having it now

16:43.980 --> 16:45.730
of all times?

16:48.060 --> 16:50.080
I'll call a physician to check her.

16:50.100 --> 16:52.080
Don't get changed yet, Mother.

16:52.100 --> 16:53.800
Let's take Yi home to make her rest first.

16:53.820 --> 16:54.950
What?

16:54.970 --> 16:57.250
Only a little cough is making you so worried?

16:57.620 --> 16:59.320
Don't you know how old I am?

16:59.340 --> 17:01.210
I'm covered with wet clothes in the wind.

17:01.210 --> 17:02.800
Aren't you worried I'll also fall ill?

17:02.820 --> 17:04.970
Go fetch my clothes.

17:04.970 --> 17:06.330
Yes.

17:23.580 --> 17:25.770
Is... is that a man over there?

17:29.170 --> 17:30.620
Mr. Meng.

17:34.620 --> 17:36.380
Close the door.

17:36.620 --> 17:38.710
No one is allowed in.

17:38.730 --> 17:40.290
- Go!
- Yes.

17:44.060 --> 17:45.080
Close the door.

17:45.100 --> 17:46.860
Let no one in.

17:48.340 --> 17:49.700
Yi,

17:49.730 --> 17:51.570
what exactly happened?

17:53.620 --> 17:55.000
Why is he here?

17:55.020 --> 17:56.490
You tramp!

17:57.170 --> 17:59.760
You had a tryst with a lowly performer

17:59.780 --> 18:00.780
while having your sister

18:00.780 --> 18:02.330
covering for you.

18:02.410 --> 18:04.040
I didn't, Mother.

18:04.060 --> 18:05.800
I came to look for Yan.

18:05.820 --> 18:08.250
I don't know why he is here either.

18:08.580 --> 18:10.870
You have to trust me, Ziyu!

18:10.890 --> 18:12.660
Trust you?

18:13.130 --> 18:14.730
He's right here.

18:14.820 --> 18:16.730
We caught you in the act.

18:16.890 --> 18:18.390
Stop denying it!

18:18.410 --> 18:19.450
I'll kill you...

18:19.450 --> 18:20.630
- Lady Zhu.
- You...!

18:20.650 --> 18:21.820
What are you doing?

18:21.820 --> 18:23.420
What am I doing?

18:23.620 --> 18:24.630
Ziyu,

18:24.650 --> 18:25.930
I'm asking you

18:25.930 --> 18:27.480
to get to the bottom of this matter.

18:27.500 --> 18:28.820
If my sister is wronged

18:28.820 --> 18:30.000
for things she didn't do,

18:30.020 --> 18:31.300
you won't look good either.

18:31.300 --> 18:33.860
Only the three of you were here.

18:36.340 --> 18:37.810
If Yi didn't do it,

18:38.020 --> 18:39.240
was it you?

18:39.260 --> 18:41.040
Si didn't do it.

18:41.060 --> 18:42.870
Really?

18:42.890 --> 18:44.810
Are you also wronged?

18:45.260 --> 18:46.950
Did that man

18:46.970 --> 18:48.760
come here himself?

18:48.780 --> 18:50.140
It was me.

18:53.500 --> 18:54.840
I had a tryst with him,

18:54.860 --> 18:56.420
not them.

18:58.970 --> 19:00.430
I came to see Meng,

19:00.450 --> 19:01.500
but Mrs. Ziyu

19:01.500 --> 19:03.040
and Miss Si walked in on us.

19:03.060 --> 19:04.480
Meng panicked.

19:04.500 --> 19:06.420
He fell off the bed and fainted.

19:06.690 --> 19:07.780
I begged the two of them

19:07.780 --> 19:09.150
to cover for me,

19:09.170 --> 19:11.280
making you mistake it.

19:11.300 --> 19:12.940
I'm really sorry.

19:22.780 --> 19:24.140
Yi,

19:24.890 --> 19:26.860
I lost my head in a fit of rage

19:27.450 --> 19:28.690
and blamed you

19:28.690 --> 19:30.290
before knowing the truth.

19:34.890 --> 19:36.810
Once Mr. Meng wakes up,

19:37.300 --> 19:39.050
I'll check everything with him

19:40.860 --> 19:42.380
and clear your name.

19:43.580 --> 19:45.460
Are you still doubting me?

20:13.650 --> 20:15.010
Qing'er.

20:15.410 --> 20:17.050
Where are you going?

20:36.260 --> 20:37.620
Lady Zhu.

20:38.540 --> 20:39.670
Young Master Zhu.

20:39.690 --> 20:41.220
Mr. Meng,

20:42.100 --> 20:44.110
don't be afraid. Tell us

20:44.130 --> 20:45.500
who you came to see

20:45.500 --> 20:47.050
for a tryst tonight.

20:47.100 --> 20:48.730
Be honest,

20:48.860 --> 20:50.390
or the Zhu Clan

20:50.410 --> 20:52.730
will show no mercy on you!

20:57.340 --> 20:58.940
It was Mrs. Ziyu.

21:04.450 --> 21:06.140
How could it be me?

21:06.860 --> 21:08.670
I had never even talked to you.

21:08.690 --> 21:09.780
Mrs. Ziyu had her maid

21:09.780 --> 21:10.620
tell me

21:10.620 --> 21:12.240
she had fallen for me a long time ago.

21:12.260 --> 21:13.910
If I didn't come to see her tonight,

21:13.930 --> 21:14.910
the Caiyun Troupe

21:14.930 --> 21:16.100
wouldn't survive in Lingshui.

21:16.100 --> 21:17.600
Nonsense!

21:17.620 --> 21:19.560
When did I fall for you?

21:19.580 --> 21:22.050
Why are you framing me?

21:22.170 --> 21:23.150
Calm down, Yi.

21:23.170 --> 21:24.430
Let me ask you.

21:24.450 --> 21:26.110
You said my sister

21:26.130 --> 21:28.180
had her maid send you a message, right?

21:28.580 --> 21:31.320
Was that maid Qing'er?

21:31.340 --> 21:32.520
You knew already.

21:32.540 --> 21:34.570
- Why ask?
- Liar!

21:34.820 --> 21:36.510
Qing'er just came to the Zhu's.

21:36.530 --> 21:37.410
Had my sister meant to

21:37.410 --> 21:38.690
arrange a secret tryst,

21:38.690 --> 21:40.560
she would've sent her confidant.

21:40.580 --> 21:42.190
Why would she choose Qing'er?

21:42.210 --> 21:43.570
It was her.

21:44.620 --> 21:46.180
She set me up.

21:48.890 --> 21:50.080
She used Yan

21:50.100 --> 21:51.810
to lure me over.

21:51.930 --> 21:52.930
Yan's over there.

21:52.930 --> 21:54.770
- Where?
- Follow me.

21:59.820 --> 22:01.970
(Qian's Nuts)
Yan's inside, Mrs. Ziyu.

22:07.620 --> 22:08.980
Ms. Fei,

22:09.730 --> 22:10.870
you claimed

22:10.890 --> 22:13.250
you had a tryst with him

22:13.970 --> 22:15.280
while he said

22:15.300 --> 22:17.900
he came to see Jiang Yi.

22:18.620 --> 22:20.380
Who exactly was it?

22:20.500 --> 22:23.250
Bring Qing'er in!

22:24.540 --> 22:25.900
Yi,

22:26.820 --> 22:28.900
I wish I could trust you.

22:30.860 --> 22:32.940
We've been married for so long.

22:33.260 --> 22:36.250
Everyone in town knows how well I treat you.

22:37.130 --> 22:39.290
Now that your statements don't match,

22:40.450 --> 22:42.280
we'll have to rely on Qing'er

22:42.300 --> 22:43.970
to clear your name

22:44.930 --> 22:48.570
and find the evildoer who set you up.

22:48.620 --> 22:49.980
Open it.

22:51.020 --> 22:52.380
Get in.

22:56.970 --> 22:58.170
Mrs. Ziyu had me

22:58.170 --> 22:59.870
send a message to Mr. Meng

22:59.890 --> 23:00.860
because I was a new maid.

23:00.860 --> 23:02.350
I wouldn't draw others' attention.

23:02.370 --> 23:03.340
She promised

23:03.340 --> 23:04.890
to send me to Ling'an after tonight,

23:04.890 --> 23:07.490
saying it was much better than Lingshui.

23:07.540 --> 23:10.320
What are you talking about, Qing'er?

23:10.340 --> 23:12.430
I shouldn't have taken you in

23:12.450 --> 23:14.280
as Si said.

23:14.300 --> 23:16.190
I never expected a young girl like you

23:16.210 --> 23:18.150
to be so evil and scheming.

23:18.170 --> 23:19.340
Mrs. Ziyu,

23:19.340 --> 23:21.340
I'm grateful for your kindness,

23:21.360 --> 23:22.210
but this is huge.

23:22.210 --> 23:23.340
I can no longer

23:23.340 --> 23:24.390
cover for you.

23:24.410 --> 23:26.170
Young Master, Lady Zhu,

23:26.170 --> 23:28.060
I filled in for Ms. Fei to dance just now.

23:28.060 --> 23:29.130
Many people saw me there.

23:29.130 --> 23:31.350
How could I've lured Mrs. Ziyu over?

23:31.370 --> 23:32.730
Right.

23:32.930 --> 23:34.320
When I left,

23:34.340 --> 23:35.630
she was dancing.

23:35.650 --> 23:37.220
She couldn't have done it.

23:38.130 --> 23:39.490
Jiang Yi,

23:39.540 --> 23:41.600
how shameless you are!

23:41.620 --> 23:43.500
And here I thought you were decent.

23:43.500 --> 23:45.770
You'd never do such indecencies.

23:46.100 --> 23:48.330
I couldn't have been more wrong!

23:48.370 --> 23:49.710
At this point,

23:49.730 --> 23:51.490
what else do you have to say?

23:51.780 --> 23:53.430
The Zhu Clan's tarnished

23:53.450 --> 23:54.890
all because of you!

23:54.890 --> 23:56.250
Mother!

23:56.300 --> 23:57.300
I didn't do it, Mother!

23:57.300 --> 23:58.170
You have to trust me!

23:58.170 --> 23:59.700
It wasn't me!

24:02.970 --> 24:04.330
I got you.

24:05.930 --> 24:07.080
Qing'er,

24:07.100 --> 24:07.970
I don't know yet

24:07.970 --> 24:09.950
how you managed to trick everyone,

24:09.970 --> 24:11.390
but mark my words.

24:11.410 --> 24:13.150
Ruining my sister's name

24:13.170 --> 24:15.050
is ruining her life.

24:15.100 --> 24:16.060
You know

24:16.060 --> 24:17.760
how well she treated you.

24:17.780 --> 24:19.500
If you still have a conscience,

24:19.500 --> 24:21.940
tell the whole truth right now!

24:21.970 --> 24:23.690
But if you keep lying

24:23.690 --> 24:24.870
and defaming her,

24:24.890 --> 24:26.730
I'll report you to the government!

24:26.780 --> 24:28.320
If the court here can't handle it,

24:28.340 --> 24:29.780
we'll go to court in Ling'an!

24:29.780 --> 24:31.140
What?

24:31.210 --> 24:32.210
Your sister committed

24:32.210 --> 24:33.410
adultery,

24:33.410 --> 24:34.870
and you're taking it to court?

24:34.890 --> 24:36.530
Are you insane?

24:37.020 --> 24:38.190
Lady Zhu,

24:38.210 --> 24:39.910
Yi already said

24:39.930 --> 24:41.240
she didn't do it.

24:41.260 --> 24:43.170
No means no, you hear me?

24:43.170 --> 24:44.530
You...

24:44.650 --> 24:46.010
Miss Si,

24:46.540 --> 24:48.220
must we go that far?

24:48.930 --> 24:50.290
Yi...

24:51.020 --> 24:53.050
No matter what she did,

24:53.540 --> 24:55.570
she's still Yan's mother

24:55.690 --> 24:57.220
and my wife.

24:57.890 --> 25:00.140
Let's deal with it within our family.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.580
Don't let it out.

25:01.580 --> 25:03.040
Don't let it out?

25:03.060 --> 25:05.190
Listen carefully, Ziyu.

25:05.210 --> 25:06.060
My sister said

25:06.060 --> 25:07.500
she didn't do it,

25:07.500 --> 25:08.650
so it wasn't her,

25:08.650 --> 25:09.490
understand?

25:09.500 --> 25:10.860
Fine.

25:10.890 --> 25:12.260
Let's say she's innocent.

25:12.260 --> 25:14.080
It was Qing'er who led her here.

25:14.100 --> 25:16.770
But everyone saw her dancing onstage.

25:16.860 --> 25:19.100
Could she be in two places at the same time?

25:24.130 --> 25:27.250
She couldn't, of course.

25:30.800 --> 25:33.960
(Yu'er)

25:34.730 --> 25:36.090
She...

25:36.820 --> 25:38.660
Two Qing'er?

25:38.820 --> 25:41.770
She was the one dancing just now.

25:42.970 --> 25:44.630
I see.

25:44.650 --> 25:47.050
They're twins.

25:47.340 --> 25:48.240
Lady Zhu,

25:48.260 --> 25:49.690
look at them.

25:49.690 --> 25:51.760
One replaced Ms. Fei to dance.

25:51.780 --> 25:54.000
The other led my sister here

25:54.020 --> 25:55.020
so that no one would

25:55.020 --> 25:56.040
believe Yi.

25:56.060 --> 25:58.530
What a vicious scheme!

25:58.930 --> 25:59.870
Mr. Yu,

25:59.890 --> 26:01.100
please hand them over

26:01.100 --> 26:02.430
to the government,

26:02.450 --> 26:04.560
- as well as him.
- No, no, no!

26:04.580 --> 26:05.430
Long Dan.

26:05.450 --> 26:07.080
No, don't!

26:07.100 --> 26:08.870
It was her. She sent the message.

26:08.890 --> 26:10.800
I didn't get to see Mrs. Ziyu's face.

26:10.820 --> 26:12.570
She impersonated Mrs. Ziyu.

26:12.620 --> 26:14.390
Everything was their idea.

26:14.410 --> 26:15.600
It had nothing to do with me!

26:15.620 --> 26:16.690
Performers sure can

26:16.690 --> 26:18.000
make up stories.

26:18.020 --> 26:19.390
See, Qing'er?

26:19.410 --> 26:20.540
He's pinned everything

26:20.540 --> 26:22.190
on you and your twin sister.

26:22.210 --> 26:24.380
Are you not going to defend yourself?

26:25.650 --> 26:27.600
Clearly, my wife and I

26:27.620 --> 26:29.940
were fooled by such an ingrate.

26:30.500 --> 26:32.050
Lately,

26:32.300 --> 26:34.350
you tried to get close to me,

26:34.370 --> 26:35.500
but I told you clearly

26:35.510 --> 26:37.180
to give up that thought

26:38.410 --> 26:40.180
and that I only loved Yi.

26:43.170 --> 26:44.060
Yet you set

26:44.060 --> 26:46.050
such a deadly trap to ruin her.

26:46.690 --> 26:48.250
What's done is done.

26:50.260 --> 26:52.180
What else do you have to say?

26:57.300 --> 26:58.600
I was greedy and jealous.

26:58.620 --> 27:00.130
Setting her up was my idea.

27:00.130 --> 27:01.800
It had nothing to do with others.

27:01.820 --> 27:03.580
My sister knew nothing about it.

27:03.600 --> 27:04.450
I only told her

27:04.450 --> 27:05.950
to dance onstage.

27:05.970 --> 27:07.660
It's all my fault!

27:15.580 --> 27:16.940
Ms. Fei...

27:18.650 --> 27:21.260
- Please!
- Don't set foot in the troupe again,

27:21.260 --> 27:22.600
or I'll break your legs!

27:22.620 --> 27:24.570
Ms. Fei, Yanniang!

27:28.410 --> 27:30.220
That troupe is cheap.

27:30.300 --> 27:31.760
It's beneath me anyway.

27:34.060 --> 27:35.700
Now that I'm out,

27:36.340 --> 27:37.560
I'll go somewhere else!

27:37.580 --> 27:39.550
(Dressing Room, Hai Hour)
The lip balm had yam.

27:39.560 --> 27:40.410
(Jiang Yi)
Then

27:40.410 --> 27:42.520
lard was smeared on my pumps.

27:42.540 --> 27:43.800
I connected the dots.

27:43.820 --> 27:45.660
Someone was coming after me.

27:45.860 --> 27:48.000
It was most likely to be Meng Nan.

27:48.020 --> 27:49.500
I was right. In the box

27:49.500 --> 27:50.670
he brought with him,

27:50.690 --> 27:52.420
I found that note,

27:52.930 --> 27:54.170
but those words on it

27:54.170 --> 27:55.390
couldn't prove anything.

27:55.410 --> 27:57.420
That's why I didn't show it.

27:59.540 --> 28:01.810
I knew someone was behind him.

28:03.130 --> 28:04.490
Ms. Fei,

28:04.730 --> 28:06.380
I have a question, though.

28:06.410 --> 28:07.600
It's said

28:07.620 --> 28:09.480
that you value reputation greatly.

28:09.500 --> 28:12.110
But just now, to help Yi out,

28:12.130 --> 28:13.500
you'd rather lie and tell them

28:13.500 --> 28:15.180
you had a tryst with Meng Nan.

28:15.500 --> 28:16.520
Why did you do that?

28:16.540 --> 28:17.870
Reputation is important,

28:17.890 --> 28:19.240
not just mine

28:19.260 --> 28:20.860
but also that of our troupe.

28:21.020 --> 28:22.910
Meng Nan was one of us.

28:22.930 --> 28:24.760
If I indulged his evil deeds,

28:24.780 --> 28:26.560
it'd ruin your sister's life

28:26.580 --> 28:27.690
and make our troupe

28:27.690 --> 28:28.930
a laughingstock.

28:28.930 --> 28:30.660
We could never perform again.

28:31.730 --> 28:33.220
I admire your integrity.

29:01.450 --> 29:02.810
Yi,

29:03.780 --> 29:05.140
are you alright?

29:07.930 --> 29:09.290
I'm fine.

29:09.620 --> 29:10.950
Let's go back.

29:10.970 --> 29:12.570
Yan is waiting at home.

29:12.690 --> 29:13.730
If I don't tuck her in,

29:13.730 --> 29:15.280
she won't go to bed again.

29:15.300 --> 29:16.660
Yi,

29:17.540 --> 29:19.530
you chose to

29:20.060 --> 29:22.420
bury the truth for her sake, right?

29:25.580 --> 29:27.490
It wasn't too big a deal anyway.

29:28.210 --> 29:29.210
Punishing the evildoer,

29:29.210 --> 29:30.560
Qing'er

29:30.580 --> 29:31.940
is enough.

29:32.340 --> 29:33.520
Yi,

29:33.540 --> 29:35.040
do you really believe

29:35.060 --> 29:36.260
a humble girl like her

29:36.260 --> 29:37.340
planned out everything alone

29:37.340 --> 29:38.950
to set you up tonight?

29:38.970 --> 29:40.000
As much as

29:40.020 --> 29:41.520
Lady Zhu disliked you,

29:41.540 --> 29:42.690
she didn't believe

29:42.690 --> 29:45.010
you'd cheat on your husband

29:45.450 --> 29:46.840
while Zhu Ziyu

29:46.860 --> 29:49.600
seemed to be on your side,

29:49.620 --> 29:52.700
everything he said was to fan the flames.

29:52.860 --> 29:54.060
He made Lady Zhu mad

29:54.060 --> 29:55.110
and eager to get changed,

29:55.130 --> 29:56.820
which was to open the closet

29:56.820 --> 29:58.480
to see if Meng Nan was inside.

29:58.500 --> 29:59.390
After Ms. Fei

29:59.410 --> 30:00.540
took responsibility

30:00.540 --> 30:02.100
for the tryst,

30:02.300 --> 30:03.930
he insisted on questioning Meng Nan

30:03.930 --> 30:04.780
once he woke up.

30:04.780 --> 30:06.020
In the end, when we meant to

30:06.020 --> 30:07.600
hand the twins over to the government,

30:07.620 --> 30:08.650
he stopped us desperately.

30:08.650 --> 30:10.010
Si,

30:11.450 --> 30:12.600
that's enough.

30:12.620 --> 30:15.420
I have to let it out.

30:16.130 --> 30:17.150
I'm sure

30:17.170 --> 30:19.350
you know the truth,

30:19.370 --> 30:21.530
but you refuse to face it.

30:21.860 --> 30:24.050
After the carriage accident

30:24.100 --> 30:26.350
and today's tryst,

30:26.370 --> 30:27.500
who knows

30:27.500 --> 30:29.940
how much worse he'll do to harm you?

30:30.410 --> 30:31.770
I'm worried

30:31.860 --> 30:32.950
that he'll

30:32.970 --> 30:35.330
use Yan to threaten you!

30:40.410 --> 30:43.050
We've been married for seven years.

30:46.580 --> 30:49.770
Does our marriage mean nothing to him?

30:54.820 --> 30:56.860
How could he be so heartless?

30:58.620 --> 31:00.860
What did I do wrong?

31:02.780 --> 31:04.140
Yi,

31:04.780 --> 31:06.940
you did nothing wrong.

31:08.020 --> 31:09.520
Evildoers do evil.

31:09.540 --> 31:11.250
They're to blame.

31:12.020 --> 31:14.460
Never blame yourself for their fault.

31:17.170 --> 31:18.900
Zhu Ziyu

31:19.300 --> 31:21.180
has fooled everyone.

31:22.890 --> 31:24.190
Whatever happened before,

31:24.210 --> 31:25.370
you must've let it slide

31:25.370 --> 31:26.690
unchecked.

31:26.690 --> 31:28.060
That's why you didn't know

31:28.060 --> 31:30.220
who meant to harm you tonight.

31:30.370 --> 31:32.460
We must get to the bottom

31:32.540 --> 31:34.770
this time

31:35.450 --> 31:37.050
so that you'll see

31:37.890 --> 31:40.460
your husband's true colors.

31:53.300 --> 31:55.180
Zhu Ziyu met with a woman.

31:55.650 --> 31:57.430
Did you get a good look at her?

31:57.450 --> 31:58.810
I couldn't.

31:59.100 --> 32:00.390
She had guards.

32:00.410 --> 32:01.500
I feared they'd be alerted,

32:01.500 --> 32:03.420
so I came back to tell you first.

32:03.540 --> 32:04.410
But I noticed

32:04.410 --> 32:05.670
that her maids were dressed up

32:05.690 --> 32:07.670
even better than some of noble birth.

32:07.690 --> 32:08.690
That woman

32:08.690 --> 32:10.380
must be of gentility.

32:10.410 --> 32:12.330
Did Zhu Ziyu

32:12.650 --> 32:14.810
have an affair with a noble lady?

32:15.100 --> 32:16.210
That'd explain why he took

32:16.210 --> 32:17.520
huge risks to ruin my sister.

32:17.540 --> 32:19.110
Without her, that lady

32:19.130 --> 32:20.800
would be his new wife.

32:20.820 --> 32:21.730
I can't believe

32:21.730 --> 32:23.330
an educated man like him

32:23.370 --> 32:25.390
would sink so low!

32:25.410 --> 32:27.080
They've been married for seven years.

32:27.100 --> 32:28.940
How could he harm her?

32:31.340 --> 32:33.460
Calm down, Captain Xie.

32:33.540 --> 32:35.220
That's only a theory.

32:38.300 --> 32:39.190
Captain,

32:39.210 --> 32:40.840
Meng Nan keeps spreading rumors,

32:40.860 --> 32:41.780
saying Mrs. Ziyu

32:41.780 --> 32:43.220
had an affair with him.

32:44.500 --> 32:46.010
That animal!

32:46.730 --> 32:48.910
Don't worry. I'll have him arrested now.

32:48.930 --> 32:50.290
Let's go!

32:51.300 --> 32:52.930
Yinlou

32:52.930 --> 32:54.970
seems outraged.

32:55.890 --> 32:57.490
It's not a big deal.

32:57.540 --> 32:58.530
Tie Meng Nan up.

32:58.550 --> 33:00.700
He'll speak with a knife against his neck.

33:01.650 --> 33:03.080
Do you still remember

33:03.100 --> 33:04.840
you're the Commandant of Capital Security?

33:04.860 --> 33:06.040
Officials shall not

33:06.060 --> 33:07.570
abuse their power.

33:07.690 --> 33:08.870
Right now,

33:08.890 --> 33:10.710
I'm only your guard.

33:10.730 --> 33:12.020
Just say the word.

33:12.020 --> 33:13.620
Your wish is my command.

33:16.450 --> 33:18.450
Is there a way to lure out that snake

33:18.450 --> 33:19.760
and the one in the dark

33:19.780 --> 33:21.490
at the same time?

33:22.310 --> 33:23.170
Meng Nan

33:23.170 --> 33:24.780
knows nothing about her identity.

33:24.780 --> 33:25.930
He's a useless pawn.

33:25.930 --> 33:29.250
Using him to get her out

33:29.620 --> 33:30.980
is hard.

33:32.730 --> 33:35.180
Zhu Ziyu has been extremely discreet.

33:35.300 --> 33:37.180
There must be a messenger

33:37.450 --> 33:39.940
between him and that woman.

33:44.440 --> 33:46.960
(Zhu Mansion)

33:56.900 --> 33:58.260
Get up.

34:01.580 --> 34:03.500
Sit, Qing'er.

34:11.130 --> 34:12.150
What do you want?

34:12.170 --> 34:13.540
Don't be afraid.

34:14.020 --> 34:15.360
I'm here

34:15.380 --> 34:16.850
only to ask you

34:16.940 --> 34:18.560
if Zhu Ziyu

34:18.580 --> 34:19.850
gave you the order

34:19.850 --> 34:21.290
to do all that.

34:22.210 --> 34:23.520
I said

34:23.540 --> 34:25.220
I did it alone.

34:27.290 --> 34:29.660
I don't expect you to sell him out.

34:30.250 --> 34:31.930
I just want to know

34:32.290 --> 34:33.810
why he did that.

34:37.730 --> 34:39.630
I have your deed.

34:39.650 --> 34:41.560
If you tell me

34:41.580 --> 34:43.810
about Zhu Ziyu's motive,

34:43.850 --> 34:45.620
you can have it back.

34:48.100 --> 34:50.220
You don't want it?

34:52.650 --> 34:54.250
What if I tell you

34:54.330 --> 34:56.140
I also have

34:56.650 --> 34:58.410
your sister's deed?

34:59.170 --> 35:00.150
What?

35:00.170 --> 35:01.020
How did it

35:01.020 --> 35:02.440
fall into your hands?

35:02.460 --> 35:04.220
I knew it.

35:04.240 --> 35:05.100
Zhu used your sister

35:05.100 --> 35:06.960
to threaten you, didn't he?

35:06.980 --> 35:08.190
I know

35:08.210 --> 35:09.940
she was a dancer.

35:09.940 --> 35:11.980
Zhu Ziyu bought her out of town.

35:12.100 --> 35:13.020
You two had been

35:13.020 --> 35:14.230
separated for years.

35:14.250 --> 35:16.270
It wasn't until last month that you reunited.

35:16.290 --> 35:17.750
As far as I know,

35:17.770 --> 35:20.080
she's the only family you've left.

35:20.100 --> 35:21.020
You're willing to

35:21.020 --> 35:22.020
take full responsibility,

35:22.020 --> 35:23.400
but do you really think

35:23.420 --> 35:25.600
Zhu Ziyu will let you live?

35:25.620 --> 35:27.890
Will you be able to see your sister again?

35:29.500 --> 35:31.110
You're protecting your sister.

35:31.130 --> 35:32.540
So am I.

35:32.580 --> 35:34.270
Your sister's been tortured by Zhu Ziyu.

35:34.290 --> 35:35.930
So has mine.

35:36.020 --> 35:37.130
We want the same thing.

35:37.130 --> 35:39.180
That is to help our family out.

35:39.210 --> 35:41.180
Isn't your sister doing well?

35:41.420 --> 35:43.100
She's been living a well-off life.

35:43.100 --> 35:44.400
Is she, really?

35:44.420 --> 35:45.330
In the Yunshui Tower,

35:45.330 --> 35:46.880
she was framed by you,

35:46.900 --> 35:48.980
which almost destroyed her.

35:49.380 --> 35:51.790
Only you and your sister

35:51.810 --> 35:53.750
know Zhu Ziyu's secrets.

35:53.770 --> 35:57.180
You probably know him better than me.

35:57.330 --> 35:58.520
Think about it.

35:58.540 --> 36:00.080
To protect himself,

36:00.100 --> 36:01.480
will he let you

36:01.500 --> 36:03.400
or your sister live?

36:03.420 --> 36:05.040
In his eyes, my sister,

36:05.060 --> 36:07.730
his lawfully wedded wife, means nothing.

36:08.020 --> 36:09.150
What about you?

36:09.170 --> 36:11.540
How much do you mean to him?

36:11.850 --> 36:12.690
You and your sister

36:12.690 --> 36:14.480
have finally reunited.

36:14.500 --> 36:15.690
You've suffered so much

36:15.690 --> 36:17.580
and finally come this far.

36:17.940 --> 36:19.750
Did you give it your all

36:19.770 --> 36:21.930
only to end up dead here?

36:23.130 --> 36:25.790
Qing'er, I want nothing from you.

36:25.810 --> 36:27.330
I simply hope

36:27.730 --> 36:28.770
you'll think about

36:28.770 --> 36:30.410
what I just said.

36:35.210 --> 36:37.140
Did she really say so?

36:37.540 --> 36:38.380
Yes.

36:38.390 --> 36:39.480
Qing'er insisted

36:39.500 --> 36:41.190
that she did everything alone.

36:41.210 --> 36:42.880
She didn't crack today.

36:42.900 --> 36:45.180
What if Jiang Si pushes her every day?

36:45.810 --> 36:47.170
Qing'er

36:47.650 --> 36:49.010
cannot live.

37:11.460 --> 37:14.140
How did you manage the house?

37:14.380 --> 37:16.710
Qing'er ran away under your watch!

37:16.730 --> 37:18.360
What else can you do?

37:18.380 --> 37:19.230
Besides,

37:19.250 --> 37:20.960
do you know Meng Nan

37:20.980 --> 37:22.700
has been spreading rumors?

37:22.940 --> 37:24.110
Right now,

37:24.130 --> 37:26.380
your affair with him has become

37:26.380 --> 37:27.960
the talk of the town.

37:27.980 --> 37:30.080
You've brought shame

37:30.100 --> 37:31.960
on the entire Zhu Clan!

37:31.980 --> 37:33.170
Sorry, it's my fault.

37:33.170 --> 37:35.620
How is that your fault, Yi?

37:35.810 --> 37:37.620
Lady Zhu, as you know,

37:37.620 --> 37:39.190
Yi was set up.

37:39.210 --> 37:41.440
Meng Nan is defaming her on purpose.

37:41.460 --> 37:42.380
You can't blame her

37:42.380 --> 37:44.450
for his nonsense.

37:45.060 --> 37:47.250
I don't blame her.

37:47.460 --> 37:49.770
I blame you.

37:50.020 --> 37:52.670
I didn't kick you out

37:52.690 --> 37:54.290
because we're in-laws.

37:55.380 --> 37:56.740
Yi,

37:56.900 --> 37:58.730
ever since your sister came,

37:58.770 --> 38:00.850
how much trouble has she caused?

38:01.020 --> 38:03.150
I heard back in Ling'an,

38:03.170 --> 38:04.880
she had crossed the line

38:04.900 --> 38:07.060
over and over.

38:07.730 --> 38:09.440
As long as she stays with us,

38:09.460 --> 38:11.500
we'll never live in peace.

38:11.540 --> 38:13.670
Leave our house today.

38:13.690 --> 38:15.600
You're no longer welcome here!

38:15.620 --> 38:16.750
Mother,

38:16.770 --> 38:17.900
you may dress me down

38:17.900 --> 38:19.560
or scold me all you want.

38:19.580 --> 38:21.730
I'm your daughter-in-law after all.

38:21.810 --> 38:23.460
But Si came all the way to visit me.

38:23.460 --> 38:25.540
You shouldn't blame her in any case.

38:25.540 --> 38:26.880
You're in no position to do so.

38:26.900 --> 38:28.270
Without her,

38:28.290 --> 38:30.000
I would've fallen off the cliff and died

38:30.020 --> 38:30.900
or been harmed

38:30.900 --> 38:32.850
by their set-up in the Yunshui Tower.

38:33.850 --> 38:35.930
Do you detest her so much

38:36.100 --> 38:37.880
because she saved my life,

38:37.900 --> 38:38.980
making you unable to

38:38.980 --> 38:41.000
have your son marry someone else

38:41.020 --> 38:43.520
who'd be perfect for him

38:43.540 --> 38:45.150
and give birth to his sons?

38:45.170 --> 38:46.530
You...

38:47.020 --> 38:48.330
Your kindness and obedience

38:48.330 --> 38:50.330
were an act.

38:50.980 --> 38:52.770
Turns out, you're as unruly

38:53.020 --> 38:54.810
as your sister.

38:55.100 --> 38:56.190
Alright then.

38:56.210 --> 38:57.940
Get out of my house,

38:57.940 --> 38:59.360
both of you!

38:59.380 --> 39:02.180
I'm your son's lawfully wedded wife.

39:02.770 --> 39:04.230
If you want me to leave,

39:04.250 --> 39:06.220
have him divorce me.

39:06.770 --> 39:08.520
Ever since we got married,

39:08.540 --> 39:10.790
I've always put the Zhu Clan first.

39:10.810 --> 39:13.040
I've never done anything indecent.

39:13.060 --> 39:14.210
Although we don't have a son,

39:14.210 --> 39:15.480
I've given birth to a daughter.

39:15.500 --> 39:17.100
I'm not guilty of sterility.

39:17.580 --> 39:19.290
Which of the Seven Criteria

39:19.460 --> 39:21.620
for Divorce have I met?

39:22.250 --> 39:23.310
You...

39:23.330 --> 39:24.460
According to the law,

39:24.460 --> 39:27.150
one who divorces his wife without reason

39:27.170 --> 39:28.360
will be jailed for 18 months.

39:28.380 --> 39:29.220
Lady Zhu,

39:29.230 --> 39:30.380
if you have your son

39:30.380 --> 39:31.850
divorce my sister like this,

39:31.850 --> 39:33.150
Earl Dongping's Mansion

39:33.170 --> 39:34.820
will file suit against you.

39:34.840 --> 39:36.310
It won't be the first one we've filed.

39:36.330 --> 39:37.730
In that case,

39:37.730 --> 39:39.100
your son will lose his freedom

39:39.100 --> 39:40.460
and his career.

39:40.730 --> 39:42.420
You'd better weigh it up.

39:42.420 --> 39:43.360
It's not

39:43.380 --> 39:45.660
up to you to divorce my sister!

39:51.020 --> 39:52.380
You...

39:52.620 --> 39:54.500
Get lost, both of you.

39:55.060 --> 39:56.420
Scram!

39:56.460 --> 39:58.700
Let's go, Yi.

40:17.980 --> 40:19.340
Captain Xie.

40:22.210 --> 40:23.660
Do as I say

40:24.210 --> 40:26.040
if you want to live.

40:26.060 --> 40:27.420
Yes.

40:31.810 --> 40:33.770
Come on, Yan!

40:35.690 --> 40:37.580
Look, Yan. Do you like it?

40:39.500 --> 40:41.450
- I always told myself
- Yan.

40:41.500 --> 40:43.410
to bear with it.

40:44.170 --> 40:46.040
But now, I feel

40:46.060 --> 40:48.930
it's great to lash out.

40:49.330 --> 40:50.690
Yi,

40:52.330 --> 40:53.730
thank you.

40:54.980 --> 40:56.110
Oh, silly.

40:56.130 --> 40:57.790
However much one can bear,

40:57.810 --> 40:59.580
there's a bottom line.

40:59.980 --> 41:02.180
You're my bottom line,

41:04.250 --> 41:05.700
as well as Yan.

41:05.940 --> 41:08.810
Mother!

41:09.540 --> 41:10.690
I'm here!

41:10.690 --> 41:12.100
- Play with me.
- I'm coming, Yan!

41:12.100 --> 41:12.980
Let's go on.

41:12.980 --> 41:14.810
- Catch it!
- Come on!

41:26.770 --> 41:28.030
Mother,

41:28.050 --> 41:29.460
don't be mad.

41:29.790 --> 41:30.900
I shouldn't have asked you

41:30.900 --> 41:32.370
to bring that up.

41:34.460 --> 41:35.820
Son,

41:36.250 --> 41:38.310
they're two peas in a pod.

41:38.330 --> 41:40.250
They're of one heart.

41:40.460 --> 41:43.220
Only you and I are family.

41:43.410 --> 41:44.260
Only if we

41:44.260 --> 41:45.720
work together

41:45.740 --> 41:46.770
can we tame

41:46.770 --> 41:47.830
those two sisters.

41:47.850 --> 41:49.470
Yi promised me

41:49.490 --> 41:50.810
that after the Water Festival,

41:50.810 --> 41:52.540
she'd made her sister leave.

41:52.980 --> 41:54.830
Now, she's changed her mind

41:54.850 --> 41:55.730
and talked back to you

41:55.730 --> 41:57.110
for her sister.

41:57.130 --> 41:58.660
Do I

42:00.730 --> 42:02.580
have to divorce her?

42:04.250 --> 42:06.330
Who said that?

42:07.290 --> 42:08.290
Didn't you

42:08.290 --> 42:09.620
always say so?

42:09.640 --> 42:10.500
Silly boy.

42:10.500 --> 42:12.980
I didn't mean what I said.

42:13.020 --> 42:15.330
I used to serve my mother-in-law, too.

42:15.460 --> 42:17.180
To be honest,

42:17.250 --> 42:18.670
except for not having a son,

42:18.690 --> 42:19.540
Yi's hardly

42:19.540 --> 42:21.020
done anything wrong.

42:21.130 --> 42:23.920
She's second to none as a wife.

42:23.940 --> 42:24.900
No one

42:24.900 --> 42:26.630
can be better than her in Lingshui.

42:26.650 --> 42:28.460
If so, why did you find fault

42:28.460 --> 42:30.100
with her in everything?

42:30.170 --> 42:31.150
Why?

42:31.170 --> 42:33.410
After your grandmother left earlier,

42:33.810 --> 42:34.900
I finally became

42:34.900 --> 42:36.370
a mother-in-law.

42:36.420 --> 42:37.460
Couldn't I

42:37.460 --> 42:39.220
show my power?

42:40.380 --> 42:41.290
Sometimes,

42:41.290 --> 42:43.080
I was actually mad at you

42:43.100 --> 42:45.810
because you always took her side.

42:49.840 --> 42:54.200
(The End of Episode 18)

42:54.650 --> 42:56.380
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.380 --> 43:01.320
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.690 --> 43:04.070
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.070 --> 43:08.300
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:09.010 --> 43:11.410
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.430 --> 43:15.090
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.110 --> 43:18.530
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.680 --> 43:24.200
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:25.020 --> 43:28.700
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.700 --> 43:32.780
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:33.020 --> 43:34.760
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.780 --> 43:39.480
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.480 --> 43:43.050
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.070 --> 43:47.300
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.320 --> 43:49.100
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.100 --> 43:53.640
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.660 --> 43:58.460
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.690 --> 44:05.220
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.240 --> 44:08.860
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.880 --> 44:12.310
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.330 --> 44:16.950
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.950 --> 44:20.640
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.660 --> 44:24.750
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.860 --> 44:26.680
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.680 --> 44:31.230
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.250 --> 44:34.950
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.970 --> 44:39.130
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.310 --> 44:41.070
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.070 --> 44:45.590
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.590 --> 44:49.230
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.250 --> 44:54.920
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.610 --> 44:58.540
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.540 --> 45:06.040
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
